&lt;section id="gradients" class="slide level2"&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Gradients&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualitative schemes: no more than 7 colors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="cell"&gt;
&lt;div class="cell-output-display"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="perception-midwest_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-8-1.png" class="lightbox" data-gallery="quarto-lightbox-gallery-14"&gt;&lt;img data-src="perception-midwest_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-8-1.png" width="672" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt; Can use &lt;code&gt;colorRampPalette()&lt;/code&gt; from the RColorBrewer package to produce larger palettes by interpolating existing ones &lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
